              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "दृष्टिकोण — dṛṣṭikoṇ — \"a point of view\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "हर आदमी का अपना दृष्टिकोण होता है। har ādmī kā apnā dṛṣṭikoṇ hotā hai. Everyone has their own point of view."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "दृष्टिकोण (dṛṣṭikoṇ) joins two Sanskrit words, dṛṣṭi, \"sight\", and koṇa, \"an angle, a corner\" (Monier-Williams): the angle one looks from. The compound is a modern one."
            }
          ]
        },
